      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAKE AND BREAK (1) comes off an average effort last start when seventh at this track over 411m behind Neon Drift (23.93) in a NG. Was in the money prior to that. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. RAPID SNIP (5) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.35 beating Joker Bonus. The form out of her last race has been franked. Deserves serious consideration again. DO RUN BANDI (7) has missed the frame at his last two runs but could not have been more impressive the run prior in his exceptional 19.93 win at Grafton over 350m. Should be in this for a long way. LARA DUTTON (3) is a chance after five-and-a-half weeks.",
